48*34*34cm 20g的600个/箱 14g的800个/箱 11g的1000个/箱 35g的500个/箱 6.5g的1000个/箱 80g的200个/箱</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">『注意事项』 </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\"> 1、本产品不可以用刀具切割</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\"> 2、材料属于易燃物品、 不可以高温长时间的烘烤&lsquo;</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\"> 3、清洗时请用中性的清洗剂清洗即可</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"background-color: #ffffff;font-size: 22.0px;color: #f44336;\"> 开票另加税点、详细请咨询客服！</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01zFlQu82BviIOTYHqp_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_5\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01b34j892BviN04ZnAU_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_6\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01JGLIIg2BviIOO70Ku_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_7\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01DB9GhD2BviIT2Dc3N_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_8\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01JmJb4J2BviIeyBzYT_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_9\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01lKxx7q2BviIeKQsXM_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_10\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01soj8G72BviIYFJL2T_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_11\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https://cbu01.alicdn.com/img/ibank/O1CN01BwIUsg2BviJWPrzFq_!!2217705558401-0-cib.jpg\" usemap=\"#_sdmap_12\"/> <img style=\"display: block;width: 100.0%;height: auto;\" src=\"https: